[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3731290898","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/114812#issuecomment-3731290898","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/114812","id":3731290898,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7eZvsS","user":{"login":"Elabsurdo984","id":180234619,"node_id":"U_kgDOCr4pew","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180234619?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elabsurdo984","html_url":"https://github.com/Elabsurdo984","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elabsurdo984/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elabsurdo984/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elabsurdo984/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elabsurdo984/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elabsurdo984/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elabsurdo984/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elabsurdo984/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elabsurdo984/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Elabsurdo984/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-01-10T01:23:36Z","updated_at":"2026-01-10T01:23:36Z","body":"I've identified the root cause of this issue. When a parent Window is invisible, `get_parent_visible_window()` returns `nullptr`. However, in three popup methods (`popup_centered()`, `popup_centered_ratio()`, and `popup_centered_clamped()`), the code was calling `get_parent_visible_window()->get_window_id()` without checking for null, causing a crash when trying to show dialogs with an invisible parent in non-embedded mode.\n\n  I have a fix ready that adds a null check and falls back to `DisplayServer::MAIN_WINDOW_ID` when no visible parent window is found. I've also added a unit test that reproduces the issue and verifies the fix.\n\n  I'll submit a PR shortly.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3731290898/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]